'''Sands''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that is obtainable by purchasing the [[Sands Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or the Beach Bundle for 3,399 Robux during the [[Summer Event 2026|2026 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
The gun has  sand in the middle, with water on the top and on the pommel, creating a shoreline. There is a large starfish above the handle and a seashell and smaller starfish at the tip.

== Trivia ==

* It pairs with the godly knife [[Beachy]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Beachy Set|Beach Set]].
* This gun has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Sands]].
